      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I haven't seen anything about this either.  I guess the question is whether the f3 events need to be considered internal in f4.  If it's ok to treat them as external events (they are from another system, after all), then I think we can just push them to the external triplestore, or post them in the audit container.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
